{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"5a096cf47b087b58a30122d7b09f7377395f000f2390f4986a58ba6ff6ad0afc","ja":"雪歩はお疲れ","zh":"雪步累坏了","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1d70834cae501ee849aef13df83a7929f8e1eece020a3c13dd1a4088f93831e2","ja":"お仕事が終わり、雪歩、まつり、環の3人で、\r\n劇場で休んでいる時のこと……","zh":"工作结束，雪步、茉莉、环3个人\n在剧场休息时发生的事……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b9ea0d5f47bf7343a96572a7ac90a1dec69dd6ff0d3f21fb1550330f1544f11c","ja":"雪歩ちゃん、環ちゃん、お疲れ様でした。\n姫のおいしい紅茶をどうぞ！なのです。","zh":"雪步、环，辛苦你们了。\n请喝公主泡的好喝红茶哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c621d2c3f03f0e07fb84226e8547aba6b02dbe7ef210e2f23e045cb796631190","ja":"わぁっ、いただきますぅ……。","zh":"哇，那我不客气啦……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"58cbf818bb9988c4aaec271edc86916c44f992ef9266095041ed3a95fa8d4a3a","ja":"美味しい～。\nなんだか疲れが飛んで行っちゃいそうだね♪","zh":"真好喝～。\n感觉疲劳好像一下子就飞走了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"708d63a4187e5223b41df7cfbb6e26e76d6cde28ca3430748589d131ed5b2c75","ja":"雪歩お姉ちゃん、疲れてるの？","zh":"雪步姐姐，你累了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"17fa8cade300e18c90c92e6cefcbaf081335ea967285c9a61ba0bce3fc3f3ae8","ja":"うん、今日はお仕事でいっぱい歩いたし。\n私にもっと体力があったら、いいんだけど……。","zh":"嗯，今天因为工作走了很多路。\n要是我能更有体力一点就好了，但是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"9e9e71c55bea447ab7e0f60a0987e3368a1881adaa5c6731624e87c38166b04b","ja":"ツアーのレッスンの時、みんな前よりすごく\n体力ついてたから、私も見習わないとね。","zh":"巡演排练的时候，大家的体力都比以前好\n太多了，我也得多向大家学习呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"58ddb4bba3a856242687dbb7d1bfd83cce31362e34f864431534cda016be49fa","ja":"体力をつけるなら、\nラジオ体操がいいぞ！","zh":"要想增强体力，\n广播体操是个好选择！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"064d46ca01495e99d739da12b4115706f3e2ca8e3392029741700f585da7816d","ja":"ほ？　小学生たちが夏休みにする、\nあのラジオ体操なのです？","zh":"哎？是小学生们在暑假里做的\n那种广播体操吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"fcc91e88ef35e4e44baf87b1ce5cbebdad699d3dfad9b8685615037e559ec6cf","ja":"うん！　同じクラスの子がね、\n「朝から元気になれた～」って言ってたんだ！","zh":"嗯！同班的同学说，\n“一早就变得很有精神了～”呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"bb380dea1fc73ca43a0204062b980f5b6d814197afefe2f7c148d14ac39dbe9c","ja":"だから、いっしょにやってみよ！\n明日の朝、劇場の裏に集合して！","zh":"所以，一起试试看吧！\n明天早上，在剧场后面集合！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"5d10fafca941b76f6591d27041495cb0e511030385f518ae49a49cf3f58656d6","ja":"えっ！　朝、劇場に！？　で、でも確かに、\n早起きして運動したら、体力はつきそうだよね……！","zh":"诶！早上来剧场吗！？不、不过确实，\n要是早起运动的话，体力应该会变好呢……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"cd8a48e59f62111cb75060c1e32514190252f80662a8f0d3fb09a2bbbd6b9702","ja":"くふふ、それじゃあ3人で頑張るぞ～！","zh":"呵呵呵，那我们3个人要一起加油哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"c1ebe47684ed9adf508f83a1f861a26352114ef3c0b91863fb45c3fc974e6abd","ja":"まつりもなのです？　ふふっ、わかったのです。\n姫はか弱いので、一緒に体力をつけるのですよ♪","zh":"茉莉也要吗？呵呵，明白了。\n公主可是很柔弱的，要一起锻炼体力哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1107.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"865fd1871d0e673bd545cb81f4e5e1d887bed62e0267a0d9d29ac212d004064f","ja":"よ、よろしくお願いします～！","zh":"请、请多关照～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
